custom background images for hosts.
- maybe possible to pick from a few pre-defined ones, or even upload your own? (maybe able to pull from some API?)
- Settings: controlling screenshot behaviour if custom backgrounds are enabled (when to show screenshots and when to show the custom background instead -- ie show screenshots for active connections, but show custom background for inactive ones)

Color scheme:
- Implement a homogenous color scheme for the app.
- Implement light theme and a toggle in the settings.
- Completely configurable color scheme for both light/dark theme
- - Colors are listed next to each other, can be changed with a color picker or by hex/rgb/hsv

Host grouping: Can create/rename/remove host groups and assign hosts to one or more groups.
- Function can be enabled/disabled in the settings
- Hosts that are not assigned to a group are in the invisible (no title visible) ungrouped-group.
- Groups can be collapsed and will show (3 active, 2 online, 5 unavailable) (can be disabled)

Reordering of hosts and groups with simple drag and drop
- - groups can be dragged over/under the ungrouped-group, and will retain their place.